{"3928880": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Echoes of Light", "steam_appid": 3928880, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Echoes of light is an action roguelike that combines the simple controls of vampire survivors with the skill based combat of Hades. You are the single spark of light in a desolate world. Awaken fallen heroes and harness their power to defeat hordes of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928880/extras/a89f8699e24ee01e0021ac0fe0f4ada1.poster.avif?t=1777663086\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928880/extras/a89f8699e24ee01e0021ac0fe0f4ada1.webm?t=1777663086\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928880/extras/a89f8699e24ee01e0021ac0fe0f4ada1.mp4?t=1777663086\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Infinite Combos</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every hero has 6 different attack configuration that can be enhanced by leveling up. Then they can be farther complimented by collecting runes that are dropped by enemies or given as event rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928880/extras/97c6cfd1a3c6d22b170f81e98c97a14c.poster.avif?t=1777663086\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928880/extras/97c6cfd1a3c6d22b170f81e98c97a14c.webm?t=1777663086\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928880/extras/97c6cfd1a3c6d22b170f81e98c97a14c.mp4?t=1777663086\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enhance your light</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock permanent upgrades for every hero by filling out their skill tree using souls collected during every run. Souls are rewarded for defeating enemies, completing events and exploring the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928880/extras/c817985a2b994cefacb86f144a16cdd5.poster.avif?t=1777663086\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928880/extras/c817985a2b994cefacb86f144a16cdd5.webm?t=1777663086\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928880/extras/c817985a2b994cefacb86f144a16cdd5.mp4?t=1777663086\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complete Events for massive rewards</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat mini bosses, claim a region, defeat powerful waves of enemies, or just defeat 100 duck sized enemies for big loot!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928880/extras/09e49a98434bf03c12268b48983b2c62.poster.avif?t=1777663086\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928880/extras/09e49a98434bf03c12268b48983b2c62.webm?t=1777663086\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928880/extras/09e49a98434bf03c12268b48983b2c62.mp4?t=1777663086\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Raid inspired boss fights</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every level culminates with a massive boss fight. Bosses each have unique abilities and multiple phases inspired by raid bosses in MMOs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928880/extras/02b662c0934491f710a7144007c5fab8.poster.avif?t=1777663086\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928880/extras/02b662c0934491f710a7144007c5fab8.webm?t=1777663086\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928880/extras/02b662c0934491f710a7144007c5fab8.mp4?t=1777663086\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quick Runs</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't be afraid to experiment with characters, attacks, and abilities. Runs are not meant to be more than 15 minutes long. So feel free to experiment without fear of washing hours down the drain because you made one bad decision early on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 playable classes each with their own massive skill tree</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 worlds to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ runes to unlock</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Echoes of light is an action roguelike that combines the simple controls of vampire survivors with the skill based combat of Hades. You are the single spark of light in a desolate world. Awaken fallen heroes and harness their power to defeat hordes of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928880/extras/a89f8699e24ee01e0021ac0fe0f4ada1.poster.avif?t=1777663086\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928880/extras/a89f8699e24ee01e0021ac0fe0f4ada1.webm?t=1777663086\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928880/extras/a89f8699e24ee01e0021ac0fe0f4ada1.mp4?t=1777663086\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Infinite Combos</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every hero has 6 different attack configuration that can be enhanced by leveling up. Then they can be farther complimented by collecting runes that are dropped by enemies or given as event rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928880/extras/97c6cfd1a3c6d22b170f81e98c97a14c.poster.avif?t=1777663086\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928880/extras/97c6cfd1a3c6d22b170f81e98c97a14c.webm?t=1777663086\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928880/extras/97c6cfd1a3c6d22b170f81e98c97a14c.mp4?t=1777663086\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enhance your light</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock permanent upgrades for every hero by filling out their skill tree using souls collected during every run. Souls are rewarded for defeating enemies, completing events and exploring the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928880/extras/c817985a2b994cefacb86f144a16cdd5.poster.avif?t=1777663086\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928880/extras/c817985a2b994cefacb86f144a16cdd5.webm?t=1777663086\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928880/extras/c817985a2b994cefacb86f144a16cdd5.mp4?t=1777663086\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complete Events for massive rewards</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat mini bosses, claim a region, defeat powerful waves of enemies, or just defeat 100 duck sized enemies for big loot!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928880/extras/09e49a98434bf03c12268b48983b2c62.poster.avif?t=1777663086\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928880/extras/09e49a98434bf03c12268b48983b2c62.webm?t=1777663086\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928880/extras/09e49a98434bf03c12268b48983b2c62.mp4?t=1777663086\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Raid inspired boss fights</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every level culminates with a massive boss fight. Bosses each have unique abilities and multiple phases inspired by raid bosses in MMOs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928880/extras/02b662c0934491f710a7144007c5fab8.poster.avif?t=1777663086\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928880/extras/02b662c0934491f710a7144007c5fab8.webm?t=1777663086\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928880/extras/02b662c0934491f710a7144007c5fab8.mp4?t=1777663086\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quick Runs</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't be afraid to experiment with characters, attacks, and abilities. Runs are not meant to be more than 15 minutes long. So feel free to experiment without fear of washing hours down the drain because you made one bad decision early on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 playable classes each with their own massive skill tree</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 worlds to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ runes to unlock</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "A lone spark in a world consumed by darkness. Revive forgotten heroes, harness their power, and forge endless combinations of upgrades as you push back hordes of enemies in this atmospheric action roguelike.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928880/74001b69aa035c64110a2777f77dd322cfc10f12/header.jpg?t=1777663086", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928880/7c8a8036eb8373e42eff1c06c0fec6cff8bc0275/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1777663086", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928880/7c8a8036eb8373e42eff1c06c0fec6cff8bc0275/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1777663086", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10.15</li></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Linux distribution released after 2016